    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "Until the spell ends, sleet falls in a 40-foot-tall, 20-foot-radius Cylinder centered on a point you choose within range. The area is Heavily Obscured, and exposed flames in the area are doused.",
        "Ground in the Cylinder is Difficult Terrain. When a creature enters the Cylinder for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or have the Prone condition and lose Concentration.",
        "* - (a miniature umbrella)"
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>Until the spell ends, sleet falls in a 40-foot-tall, 20-foot-radius <a>Cylinder</a> centered on a point you choose within range. The area is <a>Heavily Obscured</a>, and exposed flames in the area are doused.</p> <p>Ground in the Cylinder is <a>Difficult Terrain</a>. When a creature enters the Cylinder for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or have the <a>Prone</a> condition and lose <a>Concentration</a>.</p> <span>* - (a miniature umbrella)</span> </div>",
